  first | exact @GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.SW.Cpt.compact_tuples | exact GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.SW.Cpt.compact_tuples | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.SW.Cpt.compact_tuples <;> assumption)
